      "writtenOn": "2026-07-08T17:46:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, we made it virtual because there is Skia code that calls getSurfaceBase on SkCanvases that in instances where SkCanvas is a SkCaptureCanvas, it returns null.\nWe got around this by making SkCaptureCanvas::getBaseCanvasSurface() return the wrapped canvas\u0027s surface, but it looks like other places might still expect SkCaptureCanvas::getSurfaceBase() to return non-null.\nWhile N-Ways technically don\u0027t have a SurfaceBase since they can point to many canvases, we thought since CaptureCanvases only wrap 1 main canvas that we can safely say that canvas\u0027s surface is the correct return value.",
